{"unit_id":"LaplaceYoung__dsh-qq2006#feature-persist","repo":"LaplaceYoung/dsh-qq2006","commit":"ddde58e2cb8d1ff62543cc195f58a507605b7845","type":"feature","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/runtime.js:32-98"],"text":"QQ2006 Skin 的功能「保存皮肤偏好」：开关状态写入浏览器 localStorage，并可与宿主的 qq2006 设置命名空间同步，使页面刷新后仍按已保存状态启用或关闭皮肤。"}
